{"id":"ca2a9c9166fa8cce","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-class.md","title":"Class","display":"df-class — Class","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-class","aliases":["58-df-class","Class","Proper Class"],"display":"df-class — Class","depends_on":["[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-class"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-class</span><span>Class</span><span>Proper Class</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-class — Class"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9976e7d9d98187f6\" href=\"?note=9976e7d9d98187f6\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md\">../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 为集合宇宙；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 为元素均为集合的元语言类变量。类量词与集合量词区分。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_\\in=\\langle\\{\\dot\\in\\},\\varnothing,\\varnothing,\\{\\langle\\dot\\in,2\\rangle\\}\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal L_\\in=\\langle\\{\\dot\\in\\},\\varnothing,\\varnothing,\\{\\langle\\dot\\in,2\\rangle\\}\\rangle\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}\\)</span> 与变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_i\">\\(v_i\\)</span> 使用内部语法编码。</li>\n<li>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V^n\">\\(V^n\\)</span> 表示定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 的集合函数所成的元语言类；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle x\\rangle^\\frown\\bar a\">\\(\\langle x\\rangle^\\frown\\bar a\\)</span> 为长度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n+1\">\\(n+1\\)</span> 的有限赋值序列。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_{\\mathsf{meta}}\">\\(\\models_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9976e7d9d98187f6\" href=\"?note=9976e7d9d98187f6\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md\">../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md</a> 的有限公式递归语义；不是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 的集合编码真谓词。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Class}_S,\\mathrm{IsSet}_S,\\mathrm{PropClass}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Class}_S,\\mathrm{IsSet}_S,\\mathrm{PropClass}_S\\)</span> 为下式定义的元语言类谓词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Class}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Class}_S\\)</span> 保留带有限个集合参数的可定义类约定。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}class}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Class}_S(C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\\;\\exists\\bar a\\in V^n\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\n\\mathrm{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i&lt;n+1\\}\\land\\\\\n&amp;\\forall x\\in V\\;(x\\in C\\leftrightarrow\\langle V,\\in\\rangle\\models\\varphi[\\langle x\\rangle^\\frown\\bar a])\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}class}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Class}_S(C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\\;\\exists\\bar a\\in V^n\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\n\\mathrm{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i&lt;n+1\\}\\land\\\\\n&amp;\\forall x\\in V\\;(x\\in C\\leftrightarrow\\langle V,\\in\\rangle\\models\\varphi[\\langle x\\rangle^\\frown\\bar a])\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}class}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{IsSet}_S(C)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Class}_S(C)\\land\n\\exists y\\in V\\;\\forall x\\in V\\;(x\\in C\\leftrightarrow x\\in y).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}class}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{IsSet}_S(C)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Class}_S(C)\\land\n\\exists y\\in V\\;\\forall x\\in V\\;(x\\in C\\leftrightarrow x\\in y).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}class}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{PropClass}_S(C)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Class}_S(C)\\land\\neg\\mathrm{IsSet}_S(C).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}class}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{PropClass}_S(C)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Class}_S(C)\\land\\neg\\mathrm{IsSet}_S(C).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This atom uses definable classes in a two-sorted metatheory. The satisfaction relation is explicitly metatheoretic; the set-coded truth predicate for structures is not applied to the proper-class universe <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The former clause <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists x(C=x)\">\\(\\exists x(C=x)\\)</span> was tautological for every first-order object and could not distinguish sets from proper classes.</li>\n<li>Proper class: too large to be a set (e.g., <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span>, all sets)</li>\n<li>Von Neumann universe: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V = \\bigcup_{\\alpha \\in \\mathrm{Ord}} V_\\alpha\">\\(V = \\bigcup_{\\alpha \\in \\mathrm{Ord}} V_\\alpha\\)</span></li>\n<li>Foundation axiom: no infinite descending <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\in\">\\(\\in\\)</span>-chain</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Jech, Set Theory</li>\n<li>Kunen, Set Theory</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md","status":"resolved","id":"9976e7d9d98187f6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md","status":"resolved","id":"9976e7d9d98187f6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\models_{\\mathsf{meta}}$ 使用 [[../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md]] 的有限公式递归语义；不是 $V$ 的集合编码真谓词。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_\\in=\\langle\\{\\dot\\in\\},\\varnothing,\\varnothing,\\{\\langle\\dot\\in,2\\rangle\\}\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}","display":false},{"tex":"v_i","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"V^n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle x\\rangle^\\frown\\bar a","display":false},{"tex":"n+1","display":false},{"tex":"\\models_{\\mathsf{meta}}","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Class}_S,\\mathrm{IsSet}_S,\\mathrm{PropClass}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Class}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}class}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Class}_S(C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\\;\\exists\\bar a\\in V^n\\;\\Bigl(&\n\\mathrm{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i<n+1\\}\\land\\\\\n&\\forall x\\in V\\;(x\\in C\\leftrightarrow\\langle V,\\in\\rangle\\models\\varphi[\\langle x\\rangle^\\frown\\bar a])\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}class}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{IsSet}_S(C)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Class}_S(C)\\land\n\\exists y\\in V\\;\\forall x\\in V\\;(x\\in C\\leftrightarrow x\\in y).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}class}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{PropClass}_S(C)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Class}_S(C)\\land\\neg\\mathrm{IsSet}_S(C).","display":true},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists x(C=x)","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"V = \\bigcup_{\\alpha \\in \\mathrm{Ord}} V_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\in","display":false}],"bytes":2444,"backlinks":[{"id":"5e303e9d318ee426","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"02b395ed6f22c079","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8375f92593690509","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Class}_S$ (see [[58-df-class]])"},{"id":"180e55a5516174c6","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8f8c5722fd8d964f","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"